# Git delegation

- Do **not** run `git` or `gh` in the parent agent shell.
- Delegate to the **git-coordinator** subagent (`.cursor/agents/git-coordinator.md`); relay user choices and trust the **Git Report**.
- Ask which **repo_path** when unclear. Orchestration: `Agents/subagents.md`.
